# Bind-mounted container $HOME dirs (Gazebo/Qt/mesa shader cache, downloaded
# Fuel models, saved maps, audit logs) -- 269 files of exactly this got
# committed whole in 0b4298b ("a lot of stuff", 2026-09-15) before anyone
# noticed. docker/sim/ itself is gone now (see PIXI.md), but this pattern
# stays as a guard against the same mistake if a similar bind mount ever
# comes back.
docker/.*/home/
